        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: LP Analyst reviews each coupon design for fraud vectors: unique-code (not generic), per-customer-limit, expiry, channel-binding, stacking-cap; recommends design changes before launch
Responsible (R): LP Analyst
Accountable (A): Loss Prevention Mgr
Duration: 1–2 hours/design</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2244_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2244_End5" name="Complete">
