        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-196 (prevent coupon &amp; promo-code abuse.) | - CTL-403 (coupon-fraud-prevention — links to VS-125); operational: Loss Prevention Manager pre-launch sign-off
Owner: Loss Prevention Analyst</bpmn:text>
